CodeGoblin 0.4 and later is a new codebase. Versions up to 0.3 were a fork of
OpenCode (https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode, MIT License, Copyright (c)
2025 opencode), and their source remains in this repository's history.

0.4 reads the configuration and credential files of those versions
(codegoblin.jsonc, auth.json) so that an existing setup keeps working, and
its description of a model provider follows the shape used there. Where
anything in this codebase is derived from OpenCode, it is used under the MIT
License, with thanks.

CodeGoblin is not affiliated with OpenCode, Anomaly, or their maintainers.
